        <body>
            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0534" n="430" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg430"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/890.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 22, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I urgently request authority to insist that all ports be opened, on the ground
                    that the revenues of the receivership are decreased by the closure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
